ne\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>rate</mtext><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{rate}_c(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是分发时点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的汇率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>tax</mtext><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{tax}_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tax</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>duty</mtext><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{duty}_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">duty</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该法域的税与关税口径，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>round</mtext><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{round}_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是展示取整规则。三个取舍点几乎每个跨境团队都会踩：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>MAP 与成交价分离</strong> — MAP 约束&quot;对外广告展示价&quot;下限，不是成交价，也不是对经销商的供货价。必须作为<strong>独立展示价要素</strong>下发，而非覆盖成交价字段，否则渠道一开促销就穿价，或平台因低于 MAP 拒绝挂牌。</li>\n<li><strong>汇率的时点归属</strong> — 汇率不是主数据，是<strong>分发时点的环境输入</strong>，必须记入分发日志（含来源），不能在渠道侧临时查当日值；否则同一快照在不同渠道、不同时间算出不同本币价，收敛判定永不稳定。</li>\n<li><strong>价税分离口径</strong> — 北美习惯税前标价、结算加税，欧盟与多数市场要求含税展示价；同一净价要分发成&quot;税前净价&quot;或&quot;含税挂牌价&quot;。载荷须显式标注口径（如 <code>price_includes_tax</code>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渠道类型</th>\n<th>MAP 适用</th>\n<th>汇率归属</th>\n<th>展示价口径</th>\n<th>分发形态</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自营站</td>\n<td>参考</td>\n<td>分发时点</td>\n<td>含税（欧盟）/税前（北美）</td>\n<td>API 直写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台旗舰店</td>\n<td>受平台规则约束</td>\n<td>渠道侧或分发时点</td>\n<td>平台规定</td>\n<td>批量 Feed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>经销商</td>\n<td>强制</td>\n<td>合同约定</td>\n<td>通常税前供货价</td>\n<td>价目表文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>B2B 协议客户</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>分发时点</td>\n<td>税前</td>\n<td>条件记录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分发失败的典型故障与对账机制\">分发失败的典型故障与对账机制</h2><p>分发链路的故障不体现在&quot;报错&quot;，而体现在<strong>静默不一致</strong>。四类高频故障：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>静默拒绝</strong> — 渠道返回 200 但未应用（校验失败、字段名变更、SKU 未上架）。防护是回读比对，把&quot;渠道侧实际值&quot;当作唯一可信的完成证据。</li>\n<li><strong>部分成功</strong> — 一次投递 500 个 SKU，30 个因合规或库存被拒。状态机必须**按条目（per-item）**记录结果，否则重试要么全量重发浪费配额，要么漏掉那 30 个。</li>\n<li><strong>限流与队列延迟</strong> — 平台类渠道几乎都有速率限制，批量 Feeds 排队后生效时间不可控。需<strong>配额感知的调度</strong>：大促前全网调价错峰排程，为每渠道维护投递预算，否则一次全量调价打满配额，把紧急降价挤到队尾。</li>\n<li><strong>渠道侧人工改价导致的漂移</strong> — 运营在平台后台直接改价，源系统并不知道，属于<strong>分发后的状态偏移</strong>，只能靠周期对账发现：以版本指针为基线，定期拉取渠道实际价与快照目标比对，超容忍度者进入漂移队列，由人决定回灌或覆盖——不能自动化，回灌会把一次误操作固化成正式价格。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对账节奏随波动性分层：大促按小时、平时按天、长尾按周，每次留存差异快照作为取证材料。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>分发的本质是把&quot;一份已审批的价格意图&quot;翻译成每个渠道能消费的形态并投递到位，同步则保证翻译结果不漂移。三条结论值得带走：其一，<strong>分发必须是与主数据分离的一层持久状态机</strong>，因为它是 N 个跨失败域的外部副作用，超时从不等于没发生；其二，<strong>收敛只能由回读判定</strong>，投递返回码不是完成证据，容忍度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 应按渠道与币种分别标定；其三，<strong>审批、分发、生效是链路上三个独立状态</strong>，合并成一个&quot;已完成&quot;标志，是让团队在价格事故中失语的根源。落地时优先补三样：带版本指针的分发日志、按条目的批次结果、以版本指针为基线的周期对账。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"价目表向渠道分发与同步","id":"价目表向渠道分发与同步"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：分发、同步与生效是三个不同的问题","id":"核心概念-分发-同步与生效是三个不同的问题"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么分发必须是与主数据分离的一层","id":"为什么分发必须是与主数据分离的一层"},{"level":2,"text":"三种分发拓扑：推、拉与枢纽式中台","id":"三种分发拓扑-推-拉与枢纽式中台"},{"level":2,"text":"同步契约：幂等键、版本指针与收敛判定","id":"同步契约-幂等键-版本指针与收敛判定"},{"level":2,"text":"渠道差异化：MAP、汇率与价税分离在落地时的取舍","id":"渠道差异化-map-汇率与价税分离在落地时的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"分发失败的典型故障与对账机制","id":"分发失败的典型故障与对账机制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"价格变更审批流与职责分离","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-approval-distribution/price-change-approval-workflow-and-segregation"},"next":{"title":"分发失败与对账","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-channel-price-list-administration/price-approval-distribution/distribution-failure-and-reconciliation"}}